### Chat Completions
POST https://ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/coding/v3/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{volcengineCodingPlanApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "deepseek-v4-flash",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "你是人工智能助手."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "你好"
    }
  ],
  "stream": true
}


### Message
POST https://ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/coding/v1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{volcengineCodingPlanApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "deepseek-v4-flash",
  "max_tokens": 256,
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "请用一句中文解释什么是向量数据库。"
    }
  ],
  "stream": true
}

